! IEEE 123-Bus Test Feeder -- Line Impedance Codes
! Units: ohms per kilometer, nanofarads per kilometer
! All values are for the complete line section (not per-phase)
!
! Linecodes 1-9: Three-phase configurations
! Linecodes 10-11: Single-phase configurations
!
! Ampacity ratings (thermal limits) are in Amps per phase

! --------------------------------------------------------------------------
! Three-Phase Line Codes
! --------------------------------------------------------------------------

! Configuration 1: 336,400 26/7 ACSR (main trunk, heavy sections)
New Linecode.1 nphases=3 BaseFreq=60
~ rmatrix=(0.0868 | 0.0298 0.0868 | 0.0298 0.0298 0.0868)
~ xmatrix=(0.2025 | 0.0847 0.2025 | 0.0847 0.0847 0.2025)
~ cmatrix=(2.851 | -0.920 2.851 | -0.920 -0.920 2.851)
~ units=km
~ normamps=530 emergamps=636

